      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SONALI (1) finished well back at Wagga last time when a 13 length fifth (23.79) but scored three back at Broken Hill (21.82). The form out of last race has been strong. Has ability and is a key runner. SON OF BIANCA (2) has a strong record this track and trip with five wins and three placings from 14 starts. Below best last time at Goulburn (20.10) in a Free For All, finishing a 7 length fourth. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. LET'S GO OUT (4) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only a nose from the winner Dark Panther in second(18.88) at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from five attempts. Can measure up. MALA ANGEL (7) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
